+Unreleased Markmap correction: ordinary node text on screens follows the
+active preset's `--bs-body-color` through Markmap's `--markmap-text-color` API,
+including live light/dark changes and restored preferences. The mapping is
+scoped to article content and covers the generated SVG as well as its wrapper;
+later site CSS at the same specificity and inline SVG tokens remain usable.
+Printing keeps Markmap's dark ink on the white print canvas. No additional
+theme listener or replacement of vendored assets is required.
+
